# U-Boot environment, two copies (image/u-boot.config CONFIG_ENV_OFFSET,
# CONFIG_ENV_OFFSET_REDUND, CONFIG_ENV_SIZE), in the uboot partition
# (image/build.sh UBOOT_PARTUUID), which starts 0x8000 into the card:
# offsets here are from the partition start.
# Device                                                    Offset    Size
/dev/disk/by-partuuid/e659fba8-1c8f-4466-ba63-24033337a2cb  0xef8000  0x8000
/dev/disk/by-partuuid/e659fba8-1c8f-4466-ba63-24033337a2cb  0xf08000  0x8000
